---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Promo Plus | Artwork Approval Software for Promotional Products";
const description = "Manage promotional product artwork approvals, revisions and production-ready files in one workflow.";
const canonical = "https://cms.swishtag.com/platforms/promo-plus/";
const robots = "index,follow";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} robots={robots}>
  <link slot="head" rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/generic-page.css" />
  <main><section class="gp-hero"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-kicker">Promo Plus</div><h1>Move artwork approvals out of scattered email threads.</h1><p>Promo Plus gives promotional products teams one place to collect artwork decisions, revisions, approvals and production files, so orders are easier to move from sale to production.</p><div class="gp-actions"><a class="gp-btn primary" href="/book-demo/">Book a demo ↗</a><a class="gp-btn secondary" href="/solutions/">Explore solutions</a></div></div></section><section class="gp-section"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-section-head"><h2>One job, one approval trail.</h2><p>Artwork becomes risky when account teams, clients and production are working from different files or different email threads.</p></div><div class="gp-grid"><article aria-label="Open Clear approval history" class="gp-card st-clickable-card" data-card-href="/book-demo/?service=promo-plus" role="link" tabindex="0"><small>APPROVALS</small><h3>Clear approval history</h3><p>Keep comments, versions and decisions attached to the job instead of spread across inboxes.</p><a href="/book-demo/?service=promo-plus">See Promo Plus →</a></article><article aria-label="Open Production-ready output" class="gp-card st-clickable-card" data-card-href="/book-demo/?service=promo-plus" role="link" tabindex="0"><small>PRODUCTION</small><h3>Production-ready output</h3><p>Reduce the handoff between client approval and the team preparing production files.</p><a href="/book-demo/?service=promo-plus">Review the workflow →</a></article><article aria-label="Open Connect where useful" class="gp-card st-clickable-card" data-card-href="/book-demo/?service=promo-plus" role="link" tabindex="0"><small>INTEGRATIONS</small><h3>Connect where useful</h3><p>Add catalog or workflow connections when they remove repeated entry without replacing every existing system.</p><a href="/book-demo/?service=promo-plus">Discuss integrations →</a></article></div></div></section><section class="gp-section alt"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-split"><div><h2>What this page will cover</h2></div><div class="gp-list"><div>Collect the customer’s artwork decision in a controlled flow.</div><div>Keep versions and comments visible to the team.</div><div>Create a cleaner handoff into production.</div><div>Use integrations where they reduce duplicate data entry.</div></div></div></div></section><section class="gp-section"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-cta"><div><h2>Have a workflow that does not fit off-the-shelf software?</h2><p>Show us the current process. We can help identify the simplest Shopify, integration, or automation approach before you commit to a larger build.</p></div><a class="gp-btn" href="/book-demo/">Book a demo ↗</a></div><p class="gp-note">This page is connected and launch-ready. Detailed sales copy, proof, screenshots and SEO depth can be expanded in the next content pass.</p></div></section></main>
</BaseLayout>
